 "card_notes": [
  {
   "text": "| Context length    | 262K tokens (inherited from the base model; kept practical on-device by the predominantly linear-attention backbone) |",
   "source": "prism-ml/Ternary-Bonsai-2-27B-gguf README.md:L62"
  },
  {
   "text": "> - Thinking Mode: `temperature=1.0`, `top_p=0.95`, `top_k=20`, `min_p=0.05`, `presence_penalty=0.0`, `repetition_penalty=1.0`",
   "source": "prism-ml/Ternary-Bonsai-2-27B-gguf README.md:L106"
  },
  {
   "text": "> - Instruct (or non-thinking) mode: `temperature=0.7`, `top_p=0.80`, `top_k=20`, `min_p=0.0`, `presence_penalty=1.5`, `repetition_penalty=1.0`",
   "source": "prism-ml/Ternary-Bonsai-2-27B-gguf README.md:L107"
  },
  {
   "text": "well as `min_p=0.0` and followed instructions more reliably, so we recommend it for thinking mode.",
   "source": "prism-ml/Ternary-Bonsai-2-27B-gguf README.md:L110"
  },
  {
   "text": "### System Prompt",
   "source": "prism-ml/Ternary-Bonsai-2-27B-gguf README.md:L118"
  },
  {
   "text": "You can use a simple system prompt such as:",
   "source": "prism-ml/Ternary-Bonsai-2-27B-gguf README.md:L120"
  },
  {
   "text": "This is a reasoning model and it thinks by default. For the server, tool calling, reasoning budgets,",
   "source": "prism-ml/Ternary-Bonsai-2-27B-gguf README.md:L172"
  },
  {
   "text": "Evaluated with EvalScope + vLLM on NVIDIA H100 under identical infrastructure, decoding, and scoring, in **thinking mode** — where the model's full reasoning is exercised and the sub-4-bit collapse of conventional methods is most visible. 14 benchmarks across six skill categories. Bit-widths are tru",
   "source": "prism-ml/Ternary-Bonsai-2-27B-gguf README.md:L213"
  },
  {
   "text": "<summary>Expand full per-benchmark results (thinking mode)</summary>",
   "source": "prism-ml/Ternary-Bonsai-2-27B-gguf README.md:L243"
  },
  {
   "text": "**Proprietary weight-level abliteration** by the dealignai research team. Byte-identical to the base ternary quant everywhere except a small set of tensors that carry the refusal circuit. Drop-in replacement for the ternary base at inference — same tokenizer, same chat template, same reasoning modes",
   "source": "dealignai/Bonsai-2-27B-1bit-CRACK-GGUF README.md:L48"
  },
  {
   "text": "Same tokenizer, chat template, per-tensor quant policy, vision projector interface,",
   "source": "dealignai/Bonsai-2-27B-1bit-CRACK-GGUF README.md:L216"
  }
 ],
